  "body": "<div data-page-id=\"doxcn9RcAAutzQ6QglRKUXm4zDh\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcne0ccIiA0eAaAUbAthcLKtc\">The Floating Toolbar is a useful feature that provides quick access to different functions in NeoReader. In this article, you will learn more about the Floating Toolbar in NeoReader.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn6oECIYGwk86kixhIKyu8jb\"> </div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxcnQ2gOeweeGuQsm8d95fMTPb\">Standard Floating Toolbar</h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnsAWgquQMOsEAsVnBwG4Bce\">The standard Floating Toolbar is displayed during reading.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnY0YAoIOgOqyMWkkiLzDbNc\"> </div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-doxcnSqWyEOE0i4Y4y042quJ15g\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"7a2fa736-e8de-4a21-ac51-9abebed27f95\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FboxcnlRhyijPwgBdMGC2vMN0Nge%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"boxcnlRhyijPwgBdMGC2vMN0Nge\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":85890,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/10754207973396\" alt=\"9.10-1.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnSiMW4KYokGUIYVTdygZVCg\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn2u2yWQsyW6iKklrzIQ9Yhg\">To enable / disable or customize the Floating Toolbar, do the following:</div>\n<ol>\n<li>In NeoReader, tap the center area to display the main menu.</li>\n<li>Tap the hamburger menu in the top right corner and choose <strong>Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>Floating Toolbar Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>General Settings</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn0SecSYU64e6me2UbILsA5e\">Here you can also add, remove or check the description of each button.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnIy6EkCq6Qs8MecwTyWOBcf\"> </div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-doxcnuY6OGy6AO0wqSEavaGMY48\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"5b9ab8d2-d924-41ca-a9dc-f39d208285b5\",\"height\":800,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":800,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":800,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FboxcnQmUd6SD0lQgFRqP5EwmpLc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"boxcnQmUd6SD0lQgFRqP5EwmpLc\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":195431,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/10754191902356\" alt=\"9.10-2.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnYkqUGS88CqMIq8uhGK6VHd\"> </div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxcnykOgweQAsie6q2tQS7dhEd\">Handwriting Toolbar</h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnGAUeek6m6UY0Ihdbyqc52c\">The Handwriting Toolbar will be displayed in handwriting status. Please refer to <a href=\"https://help.boox.com/hc/en-us/articles/10701482227732-Take-Notes-on-Books\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Take Notes on Books</a> page in the Reading chapter for more info.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnwyuGIimkYqOAKEVLbpCoxc\"> </div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-doxcniUyeiSuCuOSMcRLitCqI2g\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"b4d734fe-92e3-4526-81e3-29492da07d40\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FboxcnNR0wc9iu9XC3brkIUoKY4d%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"boxcnNR0wc9iu9XC3brkIUoKY4d\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":88810,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/10754208023572\" alt=\"9.10-3.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn4y2GyaywI6i82n77r3Hkih\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnqMCw2Mg4OSQW2pKejAidYc\">To customize the Handwriting Toolbar, do the following:</div>\n<ol>\n<li>In NeoReader, tap the center area to display the main menu.</li>\n<li>Tap the hamburger menu in the top right corner and choose <strong>Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>Floating Toolbar Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>Handwriting Toolbar Settings</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn62qcKycCKkgS47rY5DYkpb\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnQCIWs62KgqEsy4OMbgFcBb\">Here you can also add, remove or check the description of each button.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnEoYqEOO4882yGwztVJRIae\"> </div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-doxcno4SiyQ2qeaQyu2x17WM4dc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"a3145704-0cd7-4ed8-a46c-3717df86f114\",\"height\":800,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":800,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":800,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2Fboxcnp2vEY02hkH3cWI3YkXOKGh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"boxcnp2vEY02hkH3cWI3YkXOKGh\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":145795,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/10754207975700\" alt=\"9.10-4.jpg\"></div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>"
